    "Text, photos, dates, and locations are imported into a single timeline. Titles and checklists are preserved; other rich text becomes plain text. Photos are optimized to save device storage.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Text, photos, dates, and locations are imported into a single timeline. Titles and checklists are preserved; other rich text becomes plain text. Photos are optimized to save device storage."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字、照片、日期与地点将合并导入时间线。标题与待办清单会保留，其他排版格式转换为纯文本。照片会适度压缩以节省存储空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Videos, audio, attachments, tags, and weather data are not imported. Multiple journals will be merged into one timeline. Timed entries use your current time zone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Videos, audio, attachments, tags, and weather data are not imported. Multiple journals will be merged into one timeline. Timed entries use your current time zone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "视频、音频、PDF 等附件以及标签、天气等信息不会导入。多个日记本将合并为同一个时间线；记录时间按设备当前时区显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep Liney open while importing. Cancelling keeps saved entries. You can re-import the ZIP at any time to resume or restore missing photos without overwriting your edits.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep Liney open while importing. Cancelling keeps saved entries. You can re-import the ZIP at any time to resume or restore missing photos without overwriting your edits."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导入期间请保持 Liney 处于打开状态。即使取消，已保存的日记依然保留。你可以随时重新导入该文件以继续或恢复缺失照片，不会覆盖已有的修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
